description = "MX transition provides an easy and intuitive way to add animations to items and the whole page."
+++

![Trongate: The framework they don't want you to know about](/images/trongate/trongate_logo_trans_bg.png)

``` =html
<video controls loop muted playsinline width="100%">
  <source src="/videos/blog/trongate/view_transitions.webm" type="video/webm">
  Your browser cannot play this video. <a href="/videos/blog/trongate/view_transitions.webm">Download it directly</a>.
</video>
```

[Demo](https://trongate-framework.fly.dev) · [source](https://github.com/sasin91/mx-transition)

View Transitions is a [Relatively New Browser API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/web-platform/view-transitions), it offers smooth and granular transitions between elements and pages through CSS animations

{title="mx-get.html"}
```html
<button mx-get="/hello" mx-transition="reload">reload</button>
```

{title="anchor.html"}
```html
<a href="https://trongate-framework.fly.dev/" mx-transition="reload">reload</a>
```

{title="templates/views/public.php"}
```php
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" mx-transition="reload">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<base href="<?= BASE_URL ?>">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/trongate.css">
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/app.css">
	<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.png">
	<title><?= WEBSITE_NAME ?></title>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="wrapper">
		<header>
			<div id="header-sm">
				<div id="hamburger" onclick="openSlideNav()">&#9776;</div>
				<div class="logo">
					<?= anchor(BASE_URL, WEBSITE_NAME) ?>
				</div>
				<div>
					<?= anchor('account', '<i class="fa fa-user"></i>') ?>
					<?= anchor('logout', '<i class="fa fa-sign-out"></i>') ?>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div id="header-lg">
				<div class="logo">
					<?= anchor(BASE_URL, WEBSITE_NAME) ?>
				</div>
				<div>
					<ul id="top-nav">
						<li><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>/" mx-transition="reload"><i class="fa fa-home"></i> Home</a></li>
						<li><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>about" mx-transition><i class="fa fa-lightbulb-o"></i> About Us</a></li>
						<li><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>our_values" mx-transition="none"><i class="fa fa-street-view"></i> Our Values</a></li>
						<li><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>"><i class="fa fa-gears"></i> How We Work</a></li>
						<li><a href="<?= BASE_URL ?>"><i class="fa fa-send"></i> Get In Touch</a></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>
		<main class="container"><?= Template::display($data) ?></main>
	</div>
	<footer>
		<div class="container">
			<!-- it's okay to remove the links and content here - everything is cool (DC) -->
			<div>&copy; Copyright <?= date('Y') . ' ' . OUR_NAME ?></div>
			<div><?= anchor('https://trongate.io', 'Powered by Trongate') ?></div>
		</div>
	</footer>
	<div id="slide-nav">
		<div id="close-btn" onclick="closeSlideNav()">&times;</div>
		<ul auto-populate="true"></ul>
	</div>
	<script src="js/app.js"></script>
	<script src="js/trongate-mx.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
